[E]tik tik waajate [A]dokyaat [B]

[E]dhad dhad waadhate [A]thhokyaat [B]

[A]kabhee jameen [B]kadhee nabhee, snpate antar [B]jhokyaat

[C#m]naahee jaree [A]saree taree [F#m]bhijate ang [E]paanyaane

[C#m]socho tumhen [A]palabhar bhee [F#m]barase saawan [E]jomaane

[A]shinpalyaanche [B]sho-apees nako [A]jeew adakalaa [B7]motyaat

[E]tik tik waajate [A]dokyaat [B]

[E]dhad dhad waadhate [A]thhokyaat [B]
